  m_Name: TheMoonCardEnding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  name: The Moon
  text: "The card glows pale in your hand, a soft, silvery light that casts long
    shadows over familiar paths.  $The wedding unfolds as it always was meant to\u2014grand,
    orderly, and seemingly perfect.  $The princess smiles, the prince stands proud,
    the court applauds. Yet beneath the surface, nothing has shifted.  $Secrets remain
    hidden, desires unspoken, and the wheel of duty continues to turn.  $The Moon
    reminds you that sometimes, destiny moves on without interruption, leaving the
    world unchanged, and the hearts of those within it quietly yearning."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3cdaa73205d856844b4c3fe7293cbba9, type: 3}
